  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v8.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "077d48e7a9497c3a141fec44436836600728c4a6895d5143aa18c5f988f3567f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a46b766be697c89023e3c86c5ca56486c318cdb460c59b58a68297c90038827e",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nSnowy Zigzags",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6950a1afb3a074d282523396c4726e5bb4433a5684aa4e6a5f2fcbc0b73830a3",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit waved.\n“Welcome, Wukong!”\n“Welcome, Princess Iron Fan!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "21eeacd7dbad3425d06fee3f008e7e39547c88567e76e1b209eac6cac3aa4d2d",
      "text": "Gold staff. Silver fan.\nThey tucked them in the cubby.\nBoots on. Skis ready.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "62287c33379782cb242947de444f92eb0ce9030bbf31b581d06f1ce696d8ba04",
      "text": "“My feet got long!” Wukong\nwobbled. His skis slid apart.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1320347220e44dfb3e5a8dae1bb992c96f3f7e3398bc3a52029d6fec5e911fdb",
      "text": "Coach Otter checked each\nhelmet. “Stay on the beginner\nhill.” They listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dd42832380b77bfbf09e0e997454da7c2922593b033fee4b5829332c8f3316e4",
      "text": "Wukong stepped too fast.\nPlop! A soft snow sit.\nHis tail wore a snowball.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ca111bcc189f3b008ee91b71597e5c5ac15fef2db0754cecaf4ed184994d5f5e",
      "text": "Iron Fan sat in soft snow. “A\nroyal snow cushion!” she laughed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d11d7778549f9776fd1eed4a108ac79aab29ca4635bf29c6a40f0d752fffabee",
      "text": "She stopped with a swish.\nThen she looked at the\nturn. It felt too big.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cd61b3f58cde3c9609627e262c8e3ad887f48d736eb9084b7af1d91044088970",
      "text": "Wukong bent his knees. “Easy,\nfeet!” He looked down the hill.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "be83418d44c370a200fb9f7fa008e5066a36e6a7a73840a489081b41b77aa19e",
      "text": "Coach made a wide flag path.\nJade cheered from the side:\n“Take your time!”\nWukong listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "44eac11b767a999c4de64dc0bb0eef907446248e8bc2795be7849afd939247ac",
      "text": "Iron Fan breathed out. A little\nbend. A little turn. Her skis\ncurved around the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02a45013dea7468d9af8a216129c3e319e82b0a8b4160da5da74ccc9d7609684",
      "text": "Wukong bent, then turned.\n“Slow. Turn. Stop.”\nHe stopped by the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1dcbc1bb555a677d3d4edebc9b67e4d895838b8bd63d0714155dbc8452dabb4d",
      "text": "They looked back. Two wiggly\ntracks crossed the snow. “Two\nsnowy ribbons!” cried Jade.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5fe3d3be66802e6f6b82635c7081ad755a48aa65f61da97a514b5bcee4267874",
      "text": "Three mugs of warm cocoa. A\nbowl of fish crackers. They\nblew gently. Sip, sip.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "57c9c46b2dafd2c43685474a9a537e9fdd102e65dd8d773d9861817ff0da85da",
      "text": "“My fish can’t ski!” “Mine can\nswim... in my tummy!” Crunch,\ncrunch.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b94ade83d2f74a537dbe43b9f6a40e33370101c28fee65b4b367895306066d6a",
      "text": "They drew their zigzag routes.\nJade added tiny snowflakes.\nOutside, snow fell softly.\nInside, the cocoa stayed warm.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
